From: Gabriel <gabryelfs@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 9 Jun 2026 16:48:11 -0300
Subject: [PATCH] patch(03): AES-GCM session encryption at rest for Signal
 protocol keys

Pattern copied from Malaccamaxgit/whatsapp-mcp-docker src/security/crypto.ts
(inspected 2026-06-09: pure node:crypto, no telemetry, no external imports).
Adapted: env var = SESSION_ENCRYPTION_KEY, KDF salt updated for this fork.

- src/utils/crypto.ts: AES-256-GCM + scrypt KDF helper (standalone, copy-deletable)
- baileys.auth.ts: encrypt() on write, decrypt() on read for all Signal keys + creds
- index.ts: initEncryption() at boot; warns (not fatal) if key absent to allow
  first-boot migration path

Plaintext 'enc:'-prefixed detection means existing plaintext rows still readable.

